---
// How a Time-Encrypted Vault works, drawn as a timeline: while the owner keeps renewing the date the vault
// stays closed; when the date passes, the people the owner chose open it together. Used on the home page.
---

<figure class="dc-diagram not-content">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 760 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="dc-tev-title" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
		<title id="dc-tev-title">A timeline. While you keep renewing the date, the vault stays closed. When the date you set passes, the people you chose open it together.</title>

		<text x="40" y="34" class="label head">While you renew the date, it stays closed</text>
		<text x="730" y="34" class="label head" text-anchor="end">After the date, they open it</text>

		<!-- the track -->
		<line x1="40" y1="140" x2="710" y2="140" class="track" />
		<line x1="40" y1="140" x2="520" y2="140" class="closed" />
		<line x1="520" y1="140" x2="710" y2="140" class="open" />

		<!-- today -->
		<circle cx="40" cy="140" r="7" class="point" />
		<text x="40" y="176" class="label strong" text-anchor="middle">Today</text>

		<!-- renewals -->
		<g class="renew">
			<g transform="translate(160 140)"><circle r="7" class="point" /><path d="M-6 -30 l12 0 m-5 -5 l5 5 l-5 5" class="arrow" /></g>
			<g transform="translate(280 140)"><circle r="7" class="point" /><path d="M-6 -30 l12 0 m-5 -5 l5 5 l-5 5" class="arrow" /></g>
			<g transform="translate(400 140)"><circle r="7" class="point" /><path d="M-6 -30 l12 0 m-5 -5 l5 5 l-5 5" class="arrow" /></g>
		</g>
		<text x="280" y="176" class="label" text-anchor="middle">You renew it every few months</text>
		<text x="280" y="197" class="label small" text-anchor="middle">a minute each time</text>

		<!-- the date, with the closed lock -->
		<line x1="520" y1="100" x2="520" y2="160" class="tick" />
		<g transform="translate(520 78)">
			<path d="M-9 0 v-9 a9 9 0 0 1 18 0 v9" class="shackle" />
			<rect x="-15" y="0" width="30" height="22" rx="5" class="lock" />
			<circle cy="11" r="3.5" class="keyhole" />
		</g>
		<text x="520" y="176" class="label strong" text-anchor="middle">The date you set</text>
		<text x="520" y="197" class="label small" text-anchor="middle">enforced by the Bitcoin network</text>

		<!-- after the date: the open lock and the people -->
		<g transform="translate(670 78)">
			<path d="M-9 0 v-13 a9 9 0 0 1 18 0 v2" class="shackle open" />
			<rect x="-15" y="0" width="30" height="22" rx="5" class="lock open" />
			<circle cy="11" r="3.5" class="keyhole" />
		</g>
		<g class="people" transform="translate(670 140)">
			<g transform="translate(-28 0)"><circle r="13" class="p1" /><circle cy="-3.5" r="3.6" class="face" /><path d="M-7 8.5 a7 5.5 0 0 1 14 0 z" class="face" /></g>
			<g transform="translate(0 0)"><circle r="13" class="p2" /><circle cy="-3.5" r="3.6" class="face" /><path d="M-7 8.5 a7 5.5 0 0 1 14 0 z" class="face" /></g>
			<g transform="translate(28 0)"><circle r="13" class="p3" /><circle cy="-3.5" r="3.6" class="face" /><path d="M-7 8.5 a7 5.5 0 0 1 14 0 z" class="face" /></g>
		</g>
		<text x="670" y="176" class="label strong" text-anchor="middle">The people you chose</text>
	</svg>
	<figcaption>
		Renewing is your regular "I am still here". If one day you stop, the date arrives and the group can recover
		everything. Before the date, nobody can open it: not the group, and not us.
	</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.dc-diagram {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
		overflow-x: auto;
	}
	svg {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		min-width: 34rem;
		height: auto;
		max-width: 46rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
		font-family: var(--sl-font-system, system-ui, sans-serif);
	}
	.label {
		font-size: 15px;
		fill: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.label.head {
		font-family: var(--dc-display);
		font-weight: 700;
		fill: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	.label.strong {
		font-weight: 600;
		fill: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	.label.small {
		font-size: 13px;
		fill: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.track {
		stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		stroke-width: 8;
		stroke-linecap: round;
	}
	.closed {
		stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
		stroke-width: 8;
		stroke-linecap: round;
	}
	.open {
		stroke: var(--dc-teal);
		stroke-width: 8;
		stroke-linecap: round;
	}
	.point {
		fill: var(--sl-color-bg);
		stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
		stroke-width: 3;
	}
	.arrow {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
		stroke-width: 2;
		stroke-linecap: round;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
	}
	.tick {
		stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
		stroke-width: 2;
		stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
	}
	.lock {
		fill: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
	.lock.open {
		fill: var(--dc-teal);
	}
	.shackle {
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--sl-color-accent);
		stroke-width: 4;
	}
	.shackle.open {
		stroke: var(--dc-teal);
	}
	.keyhole {
		fill: var(--sl-color-bg);
	}
	.p1 { fill: var(--dc-cyan); }
	.p2 { fill: var(--dc-magenta); }
	.p3 { fill: var(--dc-yellow); }
	.face {
		fill: #fff;
	}
	figcaption {
		max-width: 46rem;
		margin: 0.75rem auto 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
		text-align: center;
	}
</style>
